  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Ampliaci&#xF3;n y Modernizaci&#xF3;n de la Red Nacional Hidrometeorol&#xF3;gica y de Servicios de Informaci&#xF3;n Clim&#xE1;tica de Bolivia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expansion and Modernization of Bolivia&#x2019;s National Hydrometeorological and Climate Information Services Network</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es contribuir al aumento de la resiliencia clim&#xE1;tica del pa&#xED;s, a trav&#xE9;s de la ampliaci&#xF3;n y modernizaci&#xF3;n del monitoreo hidrometeorol&#xF3;gico y de los servicios de informaci&#xF3;n clim&#xE1;tica. Los objetivos espec&#xED;ficos son: (i) mejorar y desarrollar nuevos servicios de informaci&#xF3;n clim&#xE1;tica para fines de seguridad alimentaria, seguridad h&#xED;drica y gesti&#xF3;n de riesgo de desastres, con enfoque de g&#xE9;nero y diversidad; y (ii) modernizar y aumentar la cobertura territorial de la red nacional de monitoreo hidrometeorol&#xF3;gico.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to contribute to increasing the country&apos;s climate resilience by expanding and modernizing hydrometeorological monitoring and climate information services. The specific objectives are: (i) to improve and develop new climate information services for food security, water security and disaster risk management purposes, with a gender and diversity focus; and (ii) to modernize and increase the territorial coverage of the national hydrometeorological monitoring network.</narrative>
  </description>
